<title>PHILIPPINES: Don Pedro 1996/1997 output hits record.</title>
<headline>Don Pedro 1996/1997 output hits record.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine sugar miller Central Azucarera Don Pedro said on Friday it milled a record 1.5 million tonnes of cane for crop year 1996/1997 ending May 31.</p>
<p>The firm milled 1.2 million tonnes of cane in the previous crop year.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement it produced 147,000 tonnes of raw sugar for crop year 1996/1997, the second highest record in its history.</p>
<p>Don Pedro chief executive officer Pedro Roxas attributed the record performance of his company to better mill efficiency following its expansion programme.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
